# The meter: a quantity as a length, in both the places one belongs.
#
# Two clips in one, because the component is one component and the whole point is that the two
# uses are the same widget with different content. Watch the Status card first - the airtime row
# says a percentage and the bar under it says the same thing without being read - and then the
# About screen, where the same track is what a download that used to say only "downloading..."
# now reports.
#
# The bar eases between readings rather than jumping to each. That matters more than it sounds:
# the numbers behind it arrive seconds apart (the radio reports airtime on its own schedule, the
# download's byte count is whatever the staged file had grown to when the loop last looked), and
# easing across that gap is what turns a row of samples into a rate the eye can read.

scene demo
config
tab status
airtime 4 1
hold 900

# A quiet mesh fills a little of the track in the good tone. Then the air gets busy - and the
# tone, the figure's colour and the card's heading all change together, because all three ask
# mesh_ui_tone_for_load() the same question about the same number.
airtime 18 6
hold 1100
airtime 31 11
hold 1100
airtime 58 19
hold 1300

# The same bar in every theme. The track is a role (SURFACE_SEL) and the fill is a tone, so
# nothing here is switched by hand - and mesh_ui_theme_validate() is what guarantees the two
# stay tellable apart on a palette nobody has opened yet.
theme light
hold 1000
theme contrast
hold 1000
theme colorblind
hold 1200
theme dark
hold 900

# And the other use: the updater, which had no progress affordance at all.
#
# A check is one request whose reply has no length until it arrives, so the bar travels instead
# of filling - the one shape that says "working" without also claiming "this far along".
tab settings
hold 500
key a
hold 700
key down 6
update check
hold 1600

# Then the download, which does have a fraction: the release metadata said how big the asset
# would be, and the bytes on disk say how much of it has landed. The row's words carry the exact
# figure and the bar carries the shape of it.
update download 8
hold 900
update download 34
hold 900
update download 71
hold 900
update download 100
hold 1200
